  "question": {
    "text": "Tangents are drawn from the point <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> to the hyperbola <math><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math> and are inclined at angles <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi></math> and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#981;</mi></math> to the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math>-axis. If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>tan</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>tan</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#981;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>, then the value of <math><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> is",
    "image": null
  },
