  "correctValue": "7",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given hyperbola is <math><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math> or <math><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />Slope form of tangent is&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#177;</mo><msqrt><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt></math>or <math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Tangent from the point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is given by,</p><p><math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#981;</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math></p>",
